      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just doesn't feel like a \"space that aches\" anymore. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to end. everything is so grey and heavy. sometimes i look at his things and i just think... maybe it would be easier if i wasn't here to see it all. if i didn't have to carry this.",
